################################################################################
# General guidelines
################################################################################
# - Add to global gitignore if the rule is generic and benefits a wide range of users/tools/workflows
# - If you need to add a new entry to support your own local development environment/habits, add them to your local .git/info/exclude instead
# - If a rule is local to a subdirectory, consider creating a local .gitignore file

